PHASE 1: Prepare the Four Browser Tabs Before Recording

Before starting the screen recording, open your browser and prepare the following four tabs on your laptop.

Tab 1: GitHub Repository

How to open it:

1. Go to "GitHub" (https://github.com/) and log in to your account.
2. Open your Swift-Ship-Tracker repository.
3. Keep the repository page ready. It should contain the "force-app" folder and your project report in PDF format.

Tab 2: Salesforce Object Manager

How to open it:

1. Open a new browser tab and log in to your Salesforce organization.
2. Click the gear icon in the top-right corner and select Setup.
3. Open Object Manager from the top menu.
4. Locate and open the "Parcel__c" custom object.

Tab 3: Salesforce Prompt Builder

How to open it:

1. Go to the Salesforce Setup page.
2. In the Quick Find search box on the left, type "Prompt Builder".
3. Open Prompt Builder.
4. Locate and open your prompt template named Retrieve Parcel Details.

Tab 4: Agentforce Preview – Main Demo

How to open it:

1. Return to the Salesforce Setup page.
2. Search for Agents or Agentforce in the Quick Find box.
3. Open your configured agent.
4. Make sure the Preview chat panel is visible and ready for testing.
